@startuml CD-02-services
title CD-02 - Cac lop backend hien co (7feda73)\nNet dut la dependency/injection, khong khang dinh call nghiep vu da hoan thanh
hide circle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F2F7F4
skinparam classBorderColor #456657

class AuthController {
  register(dto)
  login(dto)
  getMe(user)
  getUserById(userId)
  baristaOnly()
}
class AuthService {
  register(dto)
  login(dto)
  getProfile(userId)
}
class UserRepository {
  findByUsername(username)
  findById(id)
  create(data)
}
class CatalogController {
  getProducts()
  getProductDetail(id)
}
class CatalogService {
  getProducts()
  getProductDetailById(id)
}
class CatalogRepository {
  findAllProducts()
  findDetailById(id)
}
class OrdersService {
  validateAndPriceItems(items)
}
class OrdersRepository {
  findActiveVariantById(variantId)
}
class PaymentsService <<stub>> {
  processPayment(payload, key, userId)
}
interface IPaymentGateway {
  processPayment(payload, key, userId)
}
interface IMockGatewayService {
  charge(amount, method)
}
class MockGatewayService {
  charge(amount, method)
}
class PrismaService {
  onModuleInit()
  onModuleDestroy()
}

AuthController ..> AuthService : calls
AuthService ..> UserRepository : calls
UserRepository ..> PrismaService : queries
CatalogController ..> CatalogService : calls
CatalogService ..> CatalogRepository : calls
CatalogRepository ..> PrismaService : queries
OrdersService ..> OrdersRepository : pricing only
OrdersRepository ..> PrismaService : reads variant
PaymentsService ..|> IPaymentGateway
MockGatewayService ..|> IMockGatewayService
PaymentsService ..> MockGatewayService : inject only

note bottom of PaymentsService
  processPayment nem NotImplementedException.
  Chua co payment orchestration/transaction.
  IPaymentGateway la ten interface orchestration
  trong code; IMockGatewayService moi la adapter charge.
end note
note bottom of OrdersService
  Chua co OrdersController/createOrder/transition.
  UsersService, InventoryService, PromotionsService,
  LoyaltyService trong thiet ke dich chua co runtime.
  AuthService con phu thuoc JwtService (NestJS),
  guard/DTO/mapper xem tai lieu va source rieng.
end note
@enduml
